{# ============================================================================
   INCIDENTS AT ORGANIZATION SCOPE — the frame its two screens share.

   THE FRAME IS THE SHELL'S, WHOLE. The trail, the tab strip and the scope
   control are drawn by `@Shell/org_page.html.twig` from the same `orgPages()`
   declaration the sidebar row is mounted from, so a tab and a sidebar row
   cannot disagree about which screens this module has.

   WHAT IS LEFT HERE is what only this module can say: the sheet its own
   vocabulary lives in. There is no area in it, which is the whole difference
   from the area base — an organization-level screen is the area screen one
   scope wider.
   ========================================================================== #}
{% extends '@Shell/org_page.html.twig' %}

{% block stylesheets %}
    {{ parent() }}
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset(constant('Uhifadhi\\Incident\\UhifadhiIncidentBundle::STYLESHEET')) }}">
{% endblock %}

{% block shell_page %}{% block incident_org_page %}{% endblock %}{% endblock %}
